{
  "chapter_id": "CH011",
  "title": "Reasonings and Strongholds",
  "sections": [
    {
      "section_id": "SEC043",
      "title": "The Simplicity That Is in Christ",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "In 2 Corinthians chapter 11 verse 3, Paul tells the believers, \"I fear for you, that as Eve was deceived, you also be deceived, because you live the simplicity, the simplicity that is in Christ.\" His concern is that they might be drawn away by deception from that same simplicity, just as Eve was drawn away by the serpent's subtlety.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA167",
            "REF033",
            "SRC004515",
            "SRC004516",
            "SRC004517",
            "SRC004518",
            "SRC004519",
            "SRC004522"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC004515",
            "SRC004516",
            "SRC004517",
            "SRC004518",
            "SRC004519",
            "SRC004522"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA167"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [
            "REF033"
          ],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000001",
          "provider_handle": "p1"
        },
        {
          "text": "That same letter also addresses how Paul relates to the believers in person, which turns to a different but related concern in chapter 10.",
          "kind": "connective",
          "evidence_handles": [],
          "source_refs": [],
          "idea_refs": [],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000002",
          "provider_handle": "p2"
        },
        {
          "text": "In 2 Corinthians chapter 10, Paul beseeches the believers by the meekness and the gentleness of Christ. He speaks of being bold toward them in writing while being humble when present among them, and bold when absent. He acknowledges his own power, yet insists there is a way to live among ourselves that does not simply display that power. This is a model of meekness held together with spiritual authority.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA168",
            "REF034",
            "SRC004531",
            "SRC004534",
            "SRC004539",
            "SRC004540",
            "SRC004542",
            "SRC004544",
            "SRC004546",
            "SRC004582",
            "SRC004584"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC004531",
            "SRC004534",
            "SRC004539",
            "SRC004540",
            "SRC004542",
            "SRC004544",
            "SRC004546",
            "SRC004582",
            "SRC004584",
            "SRC004588"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA168"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [
            "REF034"
          ],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000003",
          "provider_handle": "p3"
        },
        {
          "text": "In that same chapter Paul states that believers do not walk after the flesh, even though they walk in the flesh. We do walk in the flesh — we live in bodies — but we do not walk after the flesh. The brain itself, as a muscle, is flesh. So when the scripture speaks about the flesh in this sense, it is speaking of what the flesh produces or contains — carnal thinking — not simply of bodily existence itself.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA169",
            "REF034",
            "SRC004588",
            "SRC004597",
            "SRC004599",
            "SRC004611",
            "SRC004612",
            "SRC004614",
            "SRC004616"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC004588",
            "SRC004597",
            "SRC004599",
            "SRC004611",
            "SRC004612",
            "SRC004614",
            "SRC004616",
            "SRC004531",
            "SRC004534",
            "SRC004539"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA169"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [
            "REF034"
          ],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000004",
          "provider_handle": "p4"
        }
      ],
      "idea_refs": [
        "IDEA167",
        "IDEA168",
        "IDEA169"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC004515",
